[6.823, "o", "# Release readiness: product `rr-product-43478-19217`\r\n\r\nGenerated: 2026-08-29T21:05:49Z\r\n\r\n## Scope and rules\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Product scope; collection started 2026-08-29T21:05:49Z and ended 2026-08-29T21:05:56Z; 3 visible bugs. Bounded sample: #72, #73, #74. Source: `product-scope`; bounded rolling collection.\r\n- **Assumption:** `RESOLVED` and `CLOSED` are complete. `Highest` priority or literal `release-blocker` whiteboard text is release-blocking; there are no severity, keyword, flag, or custom-field blocker rules.\r\n- **Assumption:** Dependency and stale checks are selected as non-blocking risks. Dependency targets in `RESOLVED` or `CLOSED` are complete with no resolved-target override. Stale means changed before 2026-07-30T21:05:49Z (30 days before `as-of`); UTC is the release-policy time zone.\r\n- **Assumption:** Deadline, ownership, milestone, status/resolution, and history/regression checks are not selected. This is a complete zero-offset review, the root cap is 100, and Markdown is the requested artifa"]
